  "details": "When using an avatar that uses VRCFT face tracking with smoothing built-in, opening the avatar debug menu brings the framerate down significantly. The same behevior isn't see on live.\n\nHere's one if you wish to try out:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_2a692249-457c-408a-8e91-0944b0016e6e\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n- launch VRChat\n\n- swap into a VRCFT avatar\n\n- open the debug menu by going in the radial menu -> Options -> Avatar -> Debug\n\n- framerate goes down",
